NAME
     fuzzsys - what a container may ask the kernel for

SYNOPSIS
     fuzzsys check | badpid | fuzz N SEED

DESCRIPTION
     fuzzsys is three checks of the system-call boundary. `check' makes
     the twenty calls a container must not have and requires -EPERM
     from each, including from a child, which is how the filter's
     inheritance is tested. `badpid' passes impossible process numbers.
     `fuzz N SEED' makes N random calls with random arguments from that
     seed, which is how a negative pid that indexed a hash table
     backwards was found.
